<section class="protocol-use">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="pu-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">When to take, how many</span>
      <h2>When &amp; how to <em>drink it.</em></h2>
      <p>Four moments. One stick each. Stim-free, so you can take it any time of day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pu-grid">
      <div class="pu-card">
        <img class="pu-img" src="{% if section.settings.img_1 != blank %}{{ section.settings.img_1 | image_url: width: 1000 }}{% else %}{{ 'photo-gym.png' | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="Pre-training">
        <div class="when"><span class="no">01</span><span class="lbl">30–45 min before</span></div>
        <h4>Pre-training</h4>
        <p class="quote">"One 30–45 min before."</p>
        <p>Pre-load 750mg sodium, 3g citrulline and the focus stack so hydration, pump and concentration are up before you start.</p>
        <div class="spec"><b>1 stick</b> · 500–600ml cold water</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pu-card">
        <img class="pu-img" src="{% if section.settings.img_2 != blank %}{{ section.settings.img_2 | image_url: width: 1000 }}{% else %}{{ 'photo-locker.png' | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="Post-sweat">
        <div class="when"><span class="no">02</span><span class="lbl">Within 30 min after</span></div>
        <h4>Post-sweat</h4>
        <p class="quote">"One within 30 min."</p>
        <p>Electrolytes and creatine while the recovery window is open. The 30 minutes after you finish matter most.</p>
        <div class="spec"><b>1 stick</b> · 500–600ml cold water</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pu-card">
        <img class="pu-img" src="{% if section.settings.img_3 != blank %}{{ section.settings.img_3 | image_url: width: 1000 }}{% else %}{{ 'photo-kitchen.png' | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="Daily ritual">
        <div class="when"><span class="no">03</span><span class="lbl">Morning, every day</span></div>
        <h4>Daily ritual</h4>
        <p class="quote">"One every day."</p>
        <p>One a day keeps creatine saturated and electrolytes topped up — consistency is where creatine pays off.</p>
        <div class="spec"><b>1 stick</b> · even on rest days</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pu-card">
        <img class="pu-img" src="{% if section.settings.img_4 != blank %}{{ section.settings.img_4 | image_url: width: 1000 }}{% else %}{{ 'photo-padel.png' | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="Heavy days">
        <div class="when"><span class="no">04</span><span class="lbl">Long sessions / 2-a-days</span></div>
        <h4>Heavy days</h4>
        <p class="quote">"Up to 2–3 on heavy days."</p>
        <p>For long or two-a-day sessions, up to 2–3 sticks across the day is well within safe ranges. The benefit comes from daily consistency, not mega-dosing.</p>
        <div class="spec"><b>2–3 sticks</b> · across the day</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pu-foot">
      <div>
        <div class="tt">Most people settle into one stick a day, with a second before or after they train</div>
        <div class="ss">Stim-free and take-anytime. Long or two-a-day sessions? Add a second or third. Rest days: keep the daily stick for creatine.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Drink routine",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Card images" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img_1", "label": "01 · Pre-training" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img_2", "label": "02 · Post-sweat" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img_3", "label": "03 · Daily ritual" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img_4", "label": "04 · Heavy days" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Drink routine" }]
}
{% endschema %}
